{"sourceUrl":"https://scxy.ouc.edu.cn/2025/0911/c5838a505989/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:22.324237+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://scxy.ouc.edu.cn/2025/0911/c5838a505989/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span>各位考生：</span></p><p><span><span>欢迎报考水产学院推荐免试研究生。为方便考生提前做好推荐免试申请准备工作，现就</span><span>2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（含直博生）预报名相关事宜提醒如下：</span></span></p><p><strong><span>一、预报名截止时间</span></strong></p><p><span><span>中国海洋大学</span><span>2026年接收推荐免试研究生预报名系统将于</span></span><strong><span>2025年</span><span>9月14日（本周日）24点关闭</span></strong><span>，</span><span>逾期不予受理。</span><span>请有意</span><span>申请者</span><span>尽快提交申请</span><span>，</span><span>切勿错过</span><span>报名</span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>二、接收推免面试时间</span></strong></p><p><span>学院计划</span><span>2025年</span><span>9月19日-21日</span><span>期间</span><span>开展接收推荐免试研究生的综合考核。综合考核</span><span>的具体日期、</span><span>工作实施细则以及详细安排将于近日在学院网站发布，</span><span>请各位考生密切关注</span><span>。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>                                          </span><span>水产学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>                                        </span><span>2025年9月11日</span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"f8d364bc5e04538abca3ea33bda4881b5b03f402a2ac184e663aee6febb5eae6","textLength":273,"sourceSha256":"2a828ee79a017c04f2b3e95f4180851583a50f10711acabd2079cfa4861bcadd","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-0de9db9bc342c0ee7c66","title":"2025年中国海洋大学水产学院2026年接收推荐免试研究生预报名及综合考核提醒","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:22.324237+00:00"}
